// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_conhost_legacy_option.yml
// ID Sigma: 3037d961-21e9-4732-b27a-637bcc7bf539
// Título: Suspicious High IntegrityLevel Conhost Legacy Option
// Descripción: ForceV1 asks for information directly from the kernel space. Conhost connects to the console application. High IntegrityLevel means the process is running with elevated privileges, such as an Administrator context.
// Fecha de creación: 2022-12-09
// Fecha de modificación: 2024-12-01
// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: informational
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_conhost_legacy_option.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (ProcessIntegrityLevel in~ ("High", "S-1-16-12288")) and (ProcessCommandLine contains "conhost.exe" and ProcessCommandLine contains "0xffffffff" and ProcessCommandLine contains "-ForceV1")
